# What in this repository was written by somebody else, and why it is here.
# One path per line, the reason after the #. Read by toolkit/source_hygiene.py and
# toolkit/copied_strings.py so their findings are about code this port wrote.

src/main/resources/changedetection/templates  # changedetection.io's own page templates, shipped unchanged (RENDERING.md R3)
src/main/resources/changedetection/static     # changedetection.io's own stylesheets, scripts, icons and images, shipped unchanged
src/main/resources/changedetection/translations # changedetection.io's own translator-contributed wording, shipped unchanged
src/main/resources/changedetection/browser    # changedetection.io's own in-page scripts, run by the driven browser
src/main/resources/changedetection/api        # changedetection.io's own published description of its programmatic interface
